    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u5728\u4E00\u4E2A\u9700\u8981\u6709\u4EBA\u8BF4\u4E9B\u4EC0\u4E48\u7684\u65F6\u5019\uFF0C\u961F\u4F0D\u53CD\u800C\u7B2C\u4E00\u6B21\u5B89\u9759\u4E86\u4E0B\u6765\u3002"
    en: At a moment when someone should have spoken up, the team instead fell silent
      for the first time.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 0
    expression: 0
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u6240\u6709\u7684\u5FF5\u5934\u90FD\u88AB\u8FD9\u79CD\u4F1F\u5927\u800C\u7EDF\u4E00\u7684\u5949\u732E\u611F\u4E0E\u56E2\u7ED3\u62B9\u9664\u3002\u4E00\u65F6\u4E4B\u95F4\uFF0C\u6CA1\u6709\u4EBA\u63D0\u51FA\u53CD\u5BF9\u3002"
    en: Every thought was erased by this great and unified sense of devotion and
      solidarity.<br> For a brief while, no one objected.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 0
    expression: 0
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u201C\u2026\u2026\u201D"
    en: '"..."'
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
