  - cn: "\u6700\u540E\u7684\u8A00\u8BED\u90FD\u5F52\u4E8E\u4E86\u5BC2\u9759\u3002"
    en: The final words all returned to silence.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
